{
  "asyncapi": "3.0.0",
  "id": "urn:warmhouse:integration:selected-contracts:v1",
  "info": {
    "title": "Тёплый дом — Интеграция с устройствами / выбранные сообщения",
    "version": "1.0.0",
    "description": "Перспектива приложения «Интеграция с устройствами», Java 21 / Spring Framework. receive — приложение получает, send — отправляет. Срез: команды heating/lighting/gates, их результаты и нормализованная телеметрия. Bootstrap/claim, DeviceRegistered/Revoked, DeviceStateReported, видео и TelemetryRecorded не документируются этим срезом. Это проектные контракты, не развёрнутый брокер. Адрес .example иллюстративный. Бизнес-сообщения — JSON; RabbitMQ at-least-once, Inbox/Outbox, publisher confirms, consumer ACK после commit. Никаких гарантий exactly-once или глобального FIFO между разными очередями."
  },
  "servers": {
    "target": {
      "host": "broker.warmhouse.example:5671",
      "pathname": "/warmhouse",
      "protocol": "amqps",
      "protocolVersion": "0.9.1",
      "description": "Целевой RabbitMQ, vhost=warmhouse; TLS и отдельная учётная запись каждого сервиса.",
      "security": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/components/securitySchemes/serviceAccount"
        }
      ]
    }
  },
  "defaultContentType": "application/json",
  "channels": {
    "commandRequests": {
      "address": "command.requested.v1",
      "description": "Durable queue warmhouse.integration.commands.v1. Потребитель — Интеграция. Запросы пользователей напрямую в брокер не допускаются.",
      "servers": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/servers/target"
        }
      ],
      "messages": {
        "CommandRequested": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/CommandRequested"
        }
      },
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "is": "routingKey",
          "exchange": {
            "name": "warmhouse.commands",
            "type": "topic",
            "durable": true,
            "autoDelete": false,
            "vhost": "warmhouse"
          },
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0"
        }
      },
      "x-queue": "warmhouse.integration.commands.v1"
    },
    "commandResults": {
      "address": "command.result.{origin}.v1",
      "description": "Отдельная очередь каждого владельца: warmhouse.<origin>.results.v1. Автоматизация получает копии в собственной warmhouse.automation.results.v1, не конкурируя с владельцем.",
      "servers": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/servers/target"
        }
      ],
      "messages": {
        "CommandResult": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/CommandResult"
        }
      },
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "is": "routingKey",
          "exchange": {
            "name": "warmhouse.events",
            "type": "topic",
            "durable": true,
            "autoDelete": false,
            "vhost": "warmhouse"
          },
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0"
        }
      },
      "parameters": {
        "origin": {
          "enum": [
            "heating",
            "lighting",
            "gates"
          ],
          "description": "Совпадает с payload.origin; определяет владельца команды."
        }
      },
      "x-queues": [
        "warmhouse.heating.results.v1",
        "warmhouse.lighting.results.v1",
        "warmhouse.gates.results.v1",
        "warmhouse.automation.results.v1"
      ]
    },
    "telemetryReceived": {
      "address": "telemetry.received.v1",
      "description": "Durable queue warmhouse.telemetry.ingest.v1. Потребитель — Телеметрия; после записи он публикует TelemetryRecorded.v1 (за рамками выбранного среза).",
      "servers": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/servers/target"
        }
      ],
      "messages": {
        "TelemetryReceived": {
          "$ref": "#/components/messages/TelemetryReceived"
        }
      },
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "is": "routingKey",
          "exchange": {
            "name": "warmhouse.events",
            "type": "topic",
            "durable": true,
            "autoDelete": false,
            "vhost": "warmhouse"
          },
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0"
        }
      },
      "x-queue": "warmhouse.telemetry.ingest.v1"
    }
  },
  "operations": {
    "receiveCommands": {
      "action": "receive",
      "channel": {
        "$ref": "#/channels/commandRequests"
      },
      "summary": "Интеграция сохраняет Inbox+CommandDispatch, затем подтверждает AMQP. До доставки проверяет expiresAt, ACTIVE и точную версию привязки; проверка повторяется перед каждым retry.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/channels/commandRequests/messages/CommandRequested"
        }
      ],
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "deliveryMode": 2,
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0",
          "ack": true,
          "mandatory": true
        }
      }
    },
    "sendCommandResults": {
      "action": "send",
      "channel": {
        "$ref": "#/channels/commandResults"
      },
      "summary": "Интеграция записывает результат и Outbox атомарно. Приёмник применяет Inbox+статус+подтверждённое состояние транзакционно и ACK после commit. Поздний результат относится только к исходной версии привязки.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/channels/commandResults/messages/CommandResult"
        }
      ],
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "deliveryMode": 2,
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0"
        }
      }
    },
    "sendTelemetry": {
      "action": "send",
      "channel": {
        "$ref": "#/channels/telemetryReceived"
      },
      "summary": "Сначала Inbox для исходного MQTT message_id с областью deviceId/bindingVersion, нормализация и Outbox в одной TX. Повторы не создают новых eventId. Приёмник пишет Inbox+TelemetryData+Outbox TelemetryRecorded в одной TX.",
      "messages": [
        {
          "$ref": "#/channels/telemetryReceived/messages/TelemetryReceived"
        }
      ],
      "bindings": {
        "amqp": {
          "deliveryMode": 2,
          "bindingVersion": "0.3.0"
        }
      }
    }
  },
  "components": {
    "schemas": {
      "Uuid": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "uuid"
      },
      "Timestamp": {
        "type": "string",
        "format": "date-time",
        "description": "RFC 3339. В ответах время нормализуется в UTC."
      },
      "Domain": {
        "type": "string",
        "enum": [
          "heating",
          "lighting",
          "gates"
        ]
      },
      "BindingVersion": {
        "type": "integer",
        "minimum": 1,
        "format": "int64"
      },
      "Metric": {
        "type": "string",
        "pattern": "^[a-z][a-z0-9_.]{0,63}$"
      },
      "CommandFailure": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "code": {
            "type": "string",
            "pattern": "^[A-Z][A-Z0-9_]{0,63}$"
          },
          "message": {
            "type": "string",
            "minLength": 1,
            "maxLength": 256
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "code",
          "message"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "EnabledState": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "enabled": {
            "type": "boolean"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "enabled"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "GateState": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "position": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "OPEN",
              "CLOSED",
              "OPENING",
              "CLOSING",
              "UNKNOWN"
            ]
          },
          "lock": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "LOCKED",
              "UNLOCKED",
              "UNKNOWN"
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "position",
          "lock"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "CommandExecutionResult": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "confirmedState": {
            "oneOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/EnabledState"
              },
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GateState"
              }
            ]
          },
          "sequence": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "observedAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "confirmedState",
          "sequence",
          "observedAt"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "CommandOutcome": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "status": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "ACCEPTED",
              "SUCCEEDED",
              "FAILED",
              "EXPIRED",
              "UNKNOWN"
            ]
          },
          "completedAt": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "result": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandExecutionResult"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "failure": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandFailure"
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "status",
          "completedAt",
          "result",
          "failure"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "ACCEPTED"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "completedAt": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "result": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "failure": {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "SUCCEEDED"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "completedAt": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
                },
                "result": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandExecutionResult"
                },
                "failure": {
                  "type": "null"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "FAILED",
                    "EXPIRED"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "completedAt": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
                },
                "result": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "failure": {
                  "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandFailure"
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "EXPIRED"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "failure": {
                  "properties": {
                    "code": {
                      "type": "string",
                      "enum": [
                        "DEADLINE_BEFORE_SEND"
                      ]
                    }
                  }
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "status": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "UNKNOWN"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "completedAt": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "result": {
                  "type": "null"
                },
                "failure": {
                  "allOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandFailure"
                    },
                    {
                      "properties": {
                        "code": {
                          "type": "string",
                          "enum": [
                            "ACK_TIMEOUT"
                          ]
                        }
                      }
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "HeatingEnabledAction": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "heating.setEnabled"
            ]
          },
          "payload": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "enabled": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "enabled"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "payload"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "title": "heating.setEnabled"
      },
      "LightEnabledAction": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "lighting.setEnabled"
            ]
          },
          "payload": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "enabled": {
                "type": "boolean"
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "enabled"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "payload"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "title": "lighting.setEnabled"
      },
      "GatePositionAction": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "gates.setPosition"
            ]
          },
          "payload": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "position": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "OPEN",
                  "CLOSED"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "position"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "payload"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "title": "gates.setPosition"
      },
      "GateLockAction": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "action": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "gates.setLock"
            ]
          },
          "payload": {
            "type": "object",
            "properties": {
              "lock": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "LOCKED",
                  "UNLOCKED"
                ]
              }
            },
            "required": [
              "lock"
            ],
            "additionalProperties": false
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "action",
          "payload"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": false,
        "title": "gates.setLock"
      },
      "CommandAction": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HeatingEnabledAction"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LightEnabledAction"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GatePositionAction"
          },
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GateLockAction"
          }
        ]
      },
      "MetricValue": {
        "oneOf": [
          {
            "type": "number"
          },
          {
            "type": "string",
            "maxLength": 4096
          },
          {
            "type": "boolean"
          },
          {
            "type": "object",
            "maxProperties": 64
          },
          {
            "type": "array",
            "maxItems": 128
          }
        ],
        "description": "Тип и единица дополнительно проверяются по telemetry_schema DeviceType, а не только этой общей схеме."
      },
      "Measurement": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "measurementId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "sourceMessageId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "deviceId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "houseId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "bindingVersion": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BindingVersion"
          },
          "metric": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Metric"
          },
          "value": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/MetricValue"
          },
          "unit": {
            "anyOf": [
              {
                "type": "string",
                "maxLength": 32
              },
              {
                "type": "null"
              }
            ]
          },
          "quality": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "GOOD",
              "UNCERTAIN"
            ]
          },
          "sequence": {
            "type": "integer",
            "minimum": 0,
            "format": "int64"
          },
          "observedAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "receivedAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "measurementId",
          "sourceMessageId",
          "deviceId",
          "houseId",
          "bindingVersion",
          "metric",
          "value",
          "unit",
          "quality",
          "sequence",
          "observedAt",
          "receivedAt"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true
      },
      "CommandRequestedEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "eventId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "eventType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CommandRequested.v1"
            ]
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              1
            ]
          },
          "houseId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "deviceId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "bindingVersion": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BindingVersion"
          },
          "correlationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "causationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "occurredAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "origin": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Domain"
          },
          "commandId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "data": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandAction"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "eventId",
          "eventType",
          "schemaVersion",
          "houseId",
          "deviceId",
          "bindingVersion",
          "correlationId",
          "causationId",
          "occurredAt",
          "origin",
          "commandId",
          "expiresAt",
          "data"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "Функциональный сервис → интеграция. Проверять origin, активную привязку, capability и expiresAt перед каждой отправкой. Новая попытка доставки сохраняет commandId/eventId.",
        "allOf": [
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "origin": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "heating"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/HeatingEnabledAction"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "origin": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "lighting"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/LightEnabledAction"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          },
          {
            "if": {
              "properties": {
                "origin": {
                  "type": "string",
                  "enum": [
                    "gates"
                  ]
                }
              }
            },
            "then": {
              "properties": {
                "data": {
                  "oneOf": [
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GatePositionAction"
                    },
                    {
                      "$ref": "#/components/schemas/GateLockAction"
                    }
                  ]
                }
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "CommandResultData": {
        "allOf": [
          {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandOutcome"
          },
          {
            "properties": {
              "status": {
                "type": "string",
                "enum": [
                  "SUCCEEDED",
                  "FAILED",
                  "EXPIRED",
                  "UNKNOWN"
                ]
              }
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "CommandResultEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "eventId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "eventType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "CommandResult.v1"
            ]
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              1
            ]
          },
          "houseId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "deviceId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "bindingVersion": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BindingVersion"
          },
          "correlationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "causationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "occurredAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "origin": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Domain"
          },
          "commandId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "expiresAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "data": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/CommandResultData"
          }
        },
        "required": [
          "eventId",
          "eventType",
          "schemaVersion",
          "houseId",
          "deviceId",
          "bindingVersion",
          "correlationId",
          "causationId",
          "occurredAt",
          "origin",
          "commandId",
          "expiresAt",
          "data"
        ],
        "additionalProperties": true,
        "description": "Интеграция → сервис-владелец. Сопоставляются commandId, дом, устройство и версия исходной команды. PUBACK не создаёт SUCCEEDED; требуется ACK исполнения."
      },
      "TelemetryReceivedEvent": {
        "type": "object",
        "properties": {
          "eventId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "eventType": {
            "type": "string",
            "enum": [
              "TelemetryReceived.v1"
            ]
          },
          "schemaVersion": {
            "type": "integer",
            "enum": [
              1
            ]
          },
          "houseId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "deviceId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "bindingVersion": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/BindingVersion"
          },
          "correlationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "causationId": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Uuid"
          },
          "occurredAt": {
            "$ref": "#/components/schemas/Timestamp"
          },
          "data": {
